---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Why and What of this page"
	pubDate={new Date('May 23 2026')}
>
  <p>
	I'm Omar, a CS student at Tec de Monterrey. I read and experiment with distributed
	systems, functional programming, and whatever else catches my eye. I am very driven by
	intelectual curiosity and that has guided a lot of what I do.
  </p>

  <p>
	Recently, on the national evaluation for higher education institutions I got the 3rd
	highest score in my campus' June 2026 batch, with an <i>Outstanding</i> result.

	You can see my results from <a href="/ceneval">here</a>.
  </p>

  <p>
	Over the years I have learned many lessons and experimented with a lot of technologies
	and techniques, and I think some of them are worth writing about.  Maybe someone will
	find useful some of the things I document, and that's the best I can hope for.

	This page also doubles as a portfolio, a place to showcase and describe my personal
	projects.
  </p>

  <p>
	If you found anything interesting and want to reach out to me, email me at
	<a href="mailto:omar@yoyojambo.com">omar@yoyojambo.com</a>, and I'll get back to you.
  </p>

  <p>
	I themed this page after my emacs preferred theme, doom-one, part of
	the <a href="https://github.com/doomemacs/themes">Doom emacs theme megapack</a>.  You
	can also use a more traditional dark or light theme, if you don't like it. I'm new to
	frontend dev so if anything looks decent, that's on accident, but I'm doing my best
	over here.
  </p>
</Layout>
